        "content" : "Suppose that degG(x) ≥ 3. Then δ(G′) ≥ 2 and G′ has no connected component in B. There is a minimum hop dominating set S′ of G′ such that x4,v,x ∈ S′ and NG(x4) ∩ S′ ̸= ∅ by Proposition 2.7. By the choice of G, |S′| ≤ 25n. Thus S′ is a hop dominating set of G, which is a contradiction."
